pan style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">){</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">out</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">var_group_posteriors</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">crow</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">])</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">out</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    group_summary </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mean </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">group_sd</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> quantile</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> group_sd</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> probs </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0.025</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0.975</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">group_summary</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">var_group_summary</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">##########</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span></code></div><div><br><br></div><div> i.e. mean of the standard deviations of the random slopes for the variables across the donors, I get the following sd numbers:</div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"1\"> <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">               Mean.SD</font></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">(Intercept)   0.02367783</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var1_scaled   0.02391831</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var2_scaled   0.02436242</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var3_scaled   0.02447184</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var4_scaled   0.02425012</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var5_scaled   0.02422727</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var6_scaled   0.02448795</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var7_scaled   0.02397580</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var8_scaled   0.02396607</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var9_scaled   0.02422960</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var10_scaled  0.02421207</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var11_scaled  0.02438517</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var12_scaled  0.02394694</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var13_scaled  0.02419743</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var14_scaled  0.02446680</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var15_scaled  0.02400858</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var16_scaled  0.02387416</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">var17_scaled  0.02432848</font></div><div><br></div><div>While some of them such as var1 match, others such as var17 don&#39;t. I am not entirely sure why they are disagreeing. </div><div>Is what I am computing the correct way to calculate the SD and its 95% CI? If not, could you please suggest an alternative procedure?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for your time!</div><div>Jyoti</div></div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote></div>"
